1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
A frightened king told God no.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:03,560
God answered anyway.

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,480
King Ahaz from King David's family was afraid

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:06,980
of war.

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,500
God said fear not and offered any sign as proof.

6
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,040
Ahaz refused.

7
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,980
In that same war he begged a foreign king,

8
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:15,920
save me.

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,440
God chose the sign.

10
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:21,060
Behold a virgin shall conceive and bear a son

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,980
and shall call his name Immanuel.

12
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,080
Seven hundred years later it came true.

13
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:30,600
Mary, a virgin, was pregnant by God's Holy

14
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,040
Spirit.

15
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:35,000
An angel told Joseph, Joseph, thou son of David,

16
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:38,520
fear not to take unto thee Mary thy wife.

17
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:42,840
Thou shalt call his name Jesus, for he shall

18
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,000
save his people from their sins.

19
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,280
Joseph obeyed.

20
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,400
Ahaz begged a king to save him.

21
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,740
This child saves.

22
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:53,000
Immanuel means God with us.

23
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,020
With us at the cross where he died for our

24
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:55,380
sins.

25
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:57,760
On the third day he rose from the dead.

26
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:00,420
He promised, I am with you always.

27
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,240
That was God's answer.
